description_text:
Models were made in full accordance with the original. Each dynamical part is separated and has correct pivot points, that allow easy animation and use in games. 
Advanced information for each model:

  - single material for whole mesh;

  - set of 4K PBR textures;

  - set of 4K Unreal PBR textures;

  - set of 4K Unity PBR textures;

  - set of 4K CryEngine PBR textures;

  - FBX, DAE, ABC, OBJ and X3D file formats;
